{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>炎炎夏日，手機睇片打機熱到發熱？日本3C配件品牌 Hamee 聯乘Chiikawa，推出全新「Chiikawa 手機退熱貼」。這款專利散熱貼採用日本共同技研化學研發嘅「FREY」蓄熱材質，透過內部微膠囊液化吸收手機熱力並釋放至空氣中，官方實測最高可為手機激降 8.2°C，能有效延緩電池熱老化。</p><p>除了超強降溫實力，這款產品仲有 4 大實用賣點：採用 0.9mm 極薄設計，完全唔影響套手機殼；支援半永久無痕重複貼，貼住亦能正常進行無線充電；更推出Chiikawa食西瓜、飛鼠浸雜果賓治等 4 款超可愛圖案，配搭透明手機殼簡直絕配！使用時只要記得「直接貼喺手機機背」就能發揮最大功效。想要簡單款式，都有唔少牌子有推出淨色版本。</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/17880192803432733_17263547236a93025177db8.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178801928284218171_13917350996a9302546067d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178801928707735364_15324471356a93025838c7e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178801928987156168_13314601496a93025c433c2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178801929617561870_7895523256a93026084c73.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178801929823151252_19607035916a930262a2c92.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178801930033495794_6717051386a930264cf621.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-29T16:18:27.050959+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":385,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}